1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,606
Pause: scroll on purpose, stop by choice.

2
00:00:01,656 --> 00:00:04,375
Two connected interventions for doomscrolling
among students and young adults.

3
00:00:04,825 --> 00:00:06,745
Pause begins before the feed does.

4
00:00:06,795 --> 00:00:10,683
When the user taps Instagram, a
five-second breathing pause appears,

5
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:14,795
followed by three choices: continue, learn
something instead, or leave.

6
00:00:14,845 --> 00:00:18,385
The aim is to turn an automatic tap
into a conscious decision.

7
00:00:18,835 --> 00:00:22,293
Next, the user makes three small
commitments: why they are here,

8
00:00:22,343 --> 00:00:25,362
where they will stop, and what
they might do afterwards.

9
00:00:25,412 --> 00:00:29,088
Here the user wants a short break, sets
a finish line of five Reels,

10
00:00:29,138 --> 00:00:30,677
and plans to learn one thing.

11
00:00:31,127 --> 00:00:34,238
The session opens in a simulated Reels feed.

12
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:37,613
A counter at the top keeps
consumption visible:

13
00:00:37,663 --> 00:00:41,491
Reels watched against the finish
line, and time spent.

14
00:00:41,941 --> 00:00:47,080
Halfway to the finish line, a brief reminder
repeats the user’s own purpose.

15
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:52,747
It does not lock the phone; it simply brings the
original intention back into view.

16
00:00:53,197 --> 00:00:56,271
At the fifth Reel, autoplay stops.

17
00:00:56,321 --> 00:01:02,612
Instead of another video, the user
reaches a finish line and chooses:

18
00:01:02,662 --> 00:01:07,573
end the session, or consciously
take three more Reels.

19
00:01:08,023 --> 00:01:10,398
If the user continues,

20
00:01:10,448 --> 00:01:19,433
grayscale begins straight away at thirty-five
percent and deepens with every Reel,

21
00:01:19,483 --> 00:01:21,857
to sixty-five percent.

22
00:01:21,907 --> 00:01:27,146
The feed still works, but it
becomes less vivid.

23
00:01:27,596 --> 00:01:33,832
The second and final extension
starts at seventy

24
00:01:33,882 --> 00:01:39,331
percent grayscale and fades to fully gray.

25
00:01:39,381 --> 00:01:47,318
After the last Reel, both optional
extensions have been used.

26
00:01:47,768 --> 00:01:52,190
With both extensions used, there is no
further plus-three option.

27
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:55,974
In this simulated Instagram, the
Reels tab is disabled,

28
00:01:56,024 --> 00:01:59,551
but the regular feed and direct
messages still work.

29
00:01:59,601 --> 00:02:04,573
The intervention targets the distracting
feature, not the whole platform.

30
00:02:05,023 --> 00:02:10,193
When the user finishes, Pause offers one
optional, personalised idea.

31
00:02:10,243 --> 00:02:15,941
For this user, planning a trip to Rome, that
can be a useful Italian phrase.

32
00:02:15,991 --> 00:02:20,177
They can try it, ask for another
idea, or simply finish.

33
00:02:20,227 --> 00:02:22,673
Ending the session is the reward.

34
00:02:23,123 --> 00:02:25,848
In summary: Purpose Sessions add
awareness and a goal before entry;

35
00:02:25,898 --> 00:02:28,706
Reward the Exit adds visibility, stopping
points and rising friction,

36
00:02:28,756 --> 00:02:29,741
and makes leaving easier.

37
00:02:29,791 --> 00:02:32,267
This is a prototype; its effects have
not yet been evaluated.
